        "text": "With the help of artificial intelligence rules for handling data and better sensor hardware, the world's information will serve our needs dynamically and intelligently. An example is how artificial intelligence enables drug development and content creation more efficiently. How does blockchain fit into web3? The open, censorship, resistant, user owned, trustless web3 of the future needs new technologies, and blockchain provides an answer to many of these web3goals. Although blockchain technologies are still in development, they attempt to answer the question of how to manage a decentralized ecosystem built on blockchain technology. Many crypto products are expected to play critical roles. Blockchain based digital identity, crypto wallets, DeFi services, NFTs, and tokenizations are some of the crypto's existing tools that can be readily applied toward building the future Web3 ecosystem.",
